# weak_spool_alt_floor.scn — ALT_HOLD auto-takeoff, weak motors (health 0.85), the ToF reads the floor VALIDLY: the takeoff is aborted (DISARM) after 5 s
#                            ALT_HOLD の自動離陸、弱いモータ（健全度 0.85）、ToF が床を「有効に」読む: 5 s で離陸を中止（DISARM）
#
# Motor health 0.85: the craft cannot lift (see weak_spool_alt). Here the ToF dead zone is OFF (`tof_deadzone 0`): the sensor reads the true 21 mm above the floor as a VALID sample, as
# a real sensor does over a floor it can range from below 5 cm (a mat, a tilt). The healthy ToF POSITIVELY shows the craft on the floor, and its reading does not rise. Spec under test
# (detailed_design.md §3, TAKEOFF -> IDLE_GROUND row; takeoff_policy.hpp):
#  1. The controller's backstop (3 s) reports the takeoff complete, but StateTask holds the TAKEOFF while the floor evidence has held for 1 s (decideTakeoff()): no FLYING on the floor.
#  2. kAutoTakeoffNoLiftAbortUs (5 s) after the TAKEOFF began, the craft is DISARMED (the motors stop), not left spinning at the correction limit, and not sent to a LANDING (the ToF is healthy).
# An accelerometer cannot give this evidence: the abort never depends on it (weak_spool_alt_slow_lift: a craft that lifts slowly is not aborted).
#
# モータの健全度 0.85: 機体は浮けない（weak_spool_alt 参照）。ここでは ToF の不感帯を切る（`tof_deadzone 0`）: センサは床の上 21 mm の真の距離を「有効」なサンプルとして読む。
# 実センサが、5 cm 未満でも測れる床（マット、傾き）で読むのと同じ。健全な ToF が、機体は床の上にいて読みは増えないと「積極的に」示す。検証する仕様（
# detailed_design.md §3 の TAKEOFF → IDLE_GROUND の行。takeoff_policy.hpp）:
#  1. 制御器の備え（3 s）は離陸完了を報告するが、床の証拠が 1 s 続いている間は StateTask が TAKEOFF を保つ（decideTakeoff()）: 床の上で FLYING にならない。
#  2. TAKEOFF の開始から kAutoTakeoffNoLiftAbortUs（5 s）後に DISARM する（モータ停止）。補正の上限のまま回し続けず、LANDING にもしない（ToF は健全）。
# 加速度計はこの証拠を出せない: 中止は加速度計に依らない（weak_spool_alt_slow_lift: ゆっくり浮く機体は中止されない）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/weak_spool_alt_floor.scn --target vehicle --duration 16000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    tof_deadzone 0
   0    fault 0 0.85
   0    fault 1 0.85
   0    fault 2 0.85
   0    fault 3 0.85
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD (5.5 s) — spool, then the auto-takeoff climb (TAKEOFF at about 5.8 s)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     6500      50        1              # D: stick centre — the thrust rises but the craft does not lift: the abort at about 10.8 s
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50        1              # E: release the ARM button — the craft stays disarmed on the floor (to 16.0 s)
